  description: "If a card(s) is banished from the hand and/or field to activate a
    monster effect (except during the Damage Step): You can apply 1 of the following
    effects based on 1 of the card types banished.\r\n\u25CF Monster: Negate the
    effects of 1 face-up Spell/Trap on the field until the end of this turn.\r\n\u25CF
    Spell: Draw 2 cards. \u25CF Trap: Banish 1 monster on the field.\r\nIf this card
    is banished to activate a monster effect: You can add 1 of your other banished
    cards to your hand. You can only use each effect of \"Shadow Severing Strike\"
    once per turn."
